  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EARLY RECOVERY:JSB-2023-UNDP-NE</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to support early recovery and peace building in the conflict-affected communities in the north-east Nigeria. Building on the lessons and successful results of the former UNDP projects in the region, the supports to the communities will be provided using UNDP integrated community stabilization and resilience building approach for the proposed four outputs as follows: (1) Livelihood and economic opportunities of the target communities are improved, (2) Basic services are restored in target communities, (3) Effective and accountable local governance is emerging in target states, (4) Social cohesion rebuilt and community security re-established</narrative>
  </description>
